  "solution_html": "<table class=\"wimsborder\">\t <th>\t<table class=\"wimsborder\"><th>\\(\\binom{3}{2}\\) </th><th> \\(4\\)</th></table></th><th>\\({}={}\\)</th>\t <th>\t<table class=\"wimsborder\"><th>\\(\\binom{4}{1}\\) </th><th> \\(\\binom{4}{3}\\)</th></table></th><th>\\({}={}\\)</th>\t <th>\t<table class=\"wimsborder\"><th>\\(\\binom{3}{0}+\\binom{3}{1}\\) </th><th> \\(\\binom{4}{1}+\\binom{4}{2}\\)</th></table></th>\t</table>\t<p> On utilise les propriétés suivantes : </p>\t<p>Pour \\(\\left( n, \\  p\\right)\\) entiers, \\(n\\) plus grand que \\(p\\). </p>\t<ul>\t<li>\\(\\binom{n-1}{p-1}+\\binom{n-1}{p}=\\binom{n}{p}\\)</li>\t<li>\\(\\binom{n}{p}=\\binom{n}{n-p}\\)</li>\t</ul>\t<p>Par exemple avec \\(n = 8\\) et \\(p = 2\\)<ul>\t<li>\\(\\binom{8}{2}=\\binom{8-1}{2-1}+\\binom{8-1}{2}=\\binom{7}{1}+\\binom{7}{2}\\)</li>\t<li>\\(\\binom{8}{2}=\\binom{8}{8-2}=\\binom{8}{6}\\)</li>\t</ul>\t</p>\t",
